@startuml 07_component
title FleetLuma cloud components (v0.1.0 design)
component "Windows/Linux setup UI" as Setup
component "Windows/Linux agent service" as Agent
component "Flutter Web / Android" as Client
component "FastAPI pairing + device management" as Pair
component "FastAPI monitoring API" as Monitor
component "Supabase Auth" as Auth
database "Supabase private PostgreSQL" as DB
component "External scheduled checker\nSupabase Edge Function (FL-19)" as Worker
cloud "Allowlisted public HTTP endpoints" as Endpoints
Setup --> Agent : ACL protected local IPC
Agent --> Pair : request + poll pairing over HTTPS
Agent --> Monitor : authenticated report HTTPS
Client --> Pair : approved JWT + code / device actions
Client --> Monitor : approved JWT + workspace reads
Client --> Auth : operator sign in
Pair --> Auth : JWKS issuer validation
Monitor --> Auth : JWKS issuer validation
Pair --> DB : transactional enrollment
Monitor --> DB : private pooled SQL
Worker --> DB : checks / retention
Worker --> Endpoints : bounded probe
note bottom
 Cloud final design only; original local SQLite demo is 09_deployment.
 No in-process scheduled checker in Vercel.
end note
@enduml
